{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving down a dark road, heading to a Halloween party your friends have organized at a remote farm.\u00a0 But the farm carries a legend stained with despair. And someone is watching you from afar...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What begins as a celebration soon turns into blood-soaked horror.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A 90\u2019s-Inspired Slasher Survival Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scarlet Harvest is a horror survival game inspired by classic 90s slasher films. Step into tense, atmospheric locations pulled straight from a late-night horror flick.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1772472619\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, sinister cornfields, ramshackle barns, and a remote farm hiding more than one terrible secret.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy the Party\u2026 While You Can</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the nightmare unfolds, you\u2019re free to live the moment. Dance with your friends. Grab a beer. Talk, explore, and light a few firecrackers under the Halloween sky. But when the horror begins, there\u2019s no standing still. You\u2019ll have to run for your life. Fight back against your enemies. Survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1772472619\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1772472619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With dark environments, constant tension, and moments of gore, <i>The Scarlet Harvest </i>delivers a slasher-inspired horror experience where not everyone makes it to morning.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FORGETFUL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/46a62d5a94d0d7f3be10599eead4a44006e8de3e.jpg"},{"name":"ICE CUBE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/1cab27af1ec6fb773c469d63c60408aad08e2a4f.jpg"},{"name":"PARTY HARD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/8acc4617cc33e05f84521339c6b66e5a76f23547.jpg"},{"name":"I LOVE HALLOWEEN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/dfe8c009960d102f59b32e7a2bcc4d2dbd50bffb.jpg"},{"name":"THE GREEN MILE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/6295eaa2ac564448c40f0ef1cd0900f06ea8ae6c.jpg"},{"name":"WELCOME TO THE FAMILY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/94b9ce4625a658d6a6e4314636a95fb79786a110.jpg"},{"name":"BE QUICK OR BE DEAD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819310/2a4d90c7ae5ef27aa77cbd7404455950f2c20649.j